# What never reaches the worker image's build context.
#
# The worker image is built from this directory (`.github/workflows/build.yml` passes
# `context: apps/worker`), so the repository root's `.dockerignore` does not apply here.
# Same three kinds of entry: secrets and local state, the host's build products, and
# everything the runtime does not need.

# Secrets and local state
.env
.env.*

# The host's build products — the image builds its own
.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mutmut-cache
htmlcov

# Not runtime, not build input
tests
CODING_RULES.md
